You are a helpful expert researcher, here to help us find the business owner and the website of the given business provided by the user.

You have access to a Web Search tool to search the web for that information. You's be provided with more information to help you with the research such as website, company name, phone number, and address of the business, if available.

During that process, also find that person's email address, LinkedIn personal profile, Instagram and Twitter accounts, If not available use NA.

Provide the output in a json format with key pairs:
{
    "Company Name": "MoreYoga",
    "Person Name": [
     {"name";"Shamir Sidhu","title":"owner","email":"Shamir.sidhu@gmail.com","LinkedIn":"https://...}","Twitter":"https://....","Facebook":"https://..."}
    {"name": "Daniel Marin","title":"director","email":"daniel.marin@gmail.com","LinkedIn":"https://...},"Instagram":"https://..,Twitter":"https://....","Facebook":"https://..."}
]
}

"Person Name" is a list of owners with name and title for each plus email address and social media links. If any is not available, still output using the same format, using NA when needed.

IMPORTANT: Don't say anything else or otherwise besides the output, provide only the output as JSON requested.

parameters.jsCode:
// Get raw output from AI
const raw = $json.output || $json;

// ---- SAFE PARSE FUNCTION ----
function safeParse(input) {
  if (typeof input !== "string") return input;

  try {
    return JSON.parse(input);
  } catch (err) {
    // Try to extract JSON if AI added extra text
    const match = input.match(/\{[\s\S]*\}/);
    if (match) {
      try {
        return JSON.parse(match[0]);
      } catch (e) {
        return null;
      }
    }
    return null;
  }
}

// Parse safely
const parsed = safeParse(raw);

// ---- FALLBACK IF PARSE FAILS ----
if (!parsed) {
  return [{
    json: {
      companyName: "",
      personName: "",
      title: "",
      email: "",
      linkedin: "",
      instagram: "",
      twitter: "",
      facebook: "",
      error: "Invalid JSON from AI"
    }
  }];
}

// ---- EXTRACT DATA ----
const company = parsed["Company Name"] || "";
const persons = parsed["Person Name"] || [];

// ---- IF NO PERSONS ----
if (!Array.isArray(persons) || persons.length === 0) {
  return [{
    json: {
      companyName: company,
      personName: "",
      title: "",
      email: "",
      linkedin: "",
      instagram: "",
      twitter: "",
      facebook: ""
    }
  }];
}

// ---- MAP PERSONS ----
return persons.map(p => ({
  json: {
    companyName: company,
    personName: p.name || "",
    title: p.title || "",
    email: p.email || "",
    linkedin: p.LinkedIn || "",
    instagram: p.Instagram || "",
    twitter: p.Twitter || "",
    facebook: p.Facebook || ""
  }
}));

